    "https://www.buffalo.edu/administrative-services/careers-at-ub.html": {
      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers at UB - Administrative Services Gateway - University at Buffalo Skip to Content (UB) Division of Finance and Administration University at Buffalo (UB) Division of Finance and Administration Administrative Services Gateway Building partnerships through collaboration. Toggle Navigation Menu 8/4/26 Human Resources 10/13/25 Managing Facilities 10/15/25 Managing Procurement 7/17/25 Managing Money 5/6/25 Travel & Expense 5/19/26 Human Resources 10/13/25 Managing Facilities 5/15/26 Managing Procurement 4/3/25 Managing Money 7/9/26 Traveling for Business Search Administrative Services > Careers at UB Careers at UB We strive to attract the best faculty and staff to UB. Our university is extraordinary through the innovative discovery, research and accomplishments of our faculty and staff. You could go anywhere; you can make a difference here. On this page: Make A Difference UB's faculty and staff contribute to every aspect of this world-reaching enterprise. Each of us has an important job to do. You could take pride and find value in being part of this premier university. See UB in the News Experience Rewarding Benefits Working at UB comes with benefits that exceed salary alone. There are personal rewards such as health and retirement plans, training opportunities and access to recreation resources. 7/9/25 Benefits 1/8/25 Work and Life Balance Living in Western New York Join Us When you work at UB you'll have an opportunity to collaborate with people of all ages, races and interests and from nearly every culture and corner of the world. See Job Opportunities and Apply 7/25/25 Job Opportunities Under NY HELPS Program Site Index About the Division of Finance and Administration 1/21/25 Leadership and Organization 3/17/22 Staff Directory UB Directory Emergency 7/21/26 University Police 4/3/25 Emergency Management Policy, Compliance and Internal Controls 4/4/25 UB Policy Library 9/2/26 Internal Controls 4/3/25 Records Management 4/3/25 Freedom of Info