    "https://www.buffalo.edu/administrative-services/for-faculty-staff/my-paycheck/direct-deposit-faqs.html": {
      "title": "Direct Deposit",
      "description": "Direct Deposit - Administrative Services Gateway - University at Buffalo Skip to Content (UB) Division of Finance and Administration University at Buffalo (UB) Division of Finance and Administration Administrative Services Gateway Building partnerships through collaboration. Toggle Navigation Menu 8/4/26 Human Resources 10/13/25 Managing Facilities 10/15/25 Managing Procurement 7/17/25 Managing Money 5/6/25 Travel & Expense 5/19/26 Human Resources 10/13/25 Managing Facilities 5/15/26 Managing Procurement 4/3/25 Managing Money 7/9/26 Traveling for Business Search Administrative Services > Human Resources > My Paycheck > Direct Deposit Human Resources Getting Started at UB Information About Me My Benefits Managing My Time My Paycheck Direct Deposit Extra Service Payment Dates for State Employees Taxes For International Students, Scholars and Guests Workers' Compensation Relocation Services Customer Service HR Newsletter HR Annual Events Calendar Managing HR For Faculty and Staff — Site Map Required Annual Training for Faculty and Staff Direct Deposit Employees may request direct deposit enrollment, changes or cancellations. On this page: Frequently Asked Questions Can I have my pay directed to more than one financial institution or account using direct deposit? Yes,  you can have up to eight different savings or checking accounts in one or more financial institutions. You can even change the amount that goes in each account. However, the distribtion of funds for loans, mortgages and other transactions must be arranged with your financial institution. Can my direct deposit go to a joint account? Yes, however, the joint account holder must also sign the enrollment form. How can I change my direct deposit bank account? You would submit a new enrollment form to cancel direct deposit for one or all of your accounts. It is important to keep both accounts open until the new account begins to receive your salary. 3/25/25 Complete a New State Direct Deposit 11/6/15 Complete a New Research Foundation Direct Deposit Complete a New UB Foundation Direct Deposit How do I cancel direct deposit for one or more accounts? Submit a new enrollment form to cancel direct deposit for one or all of your accounts. It is important to keep all accounts open until the change takes effect. 3/25/25 Complete a New State Direct Deposit 11/6/15 Complete a New Research Foundation Direct Deposit Complete a New UB Foundation Direct Deposit Who can I contact about my direct deposit transactions? You may contact your financial institution about any banking transactions. Will my direct deposit transfer if I move from one state agency to another, go on Leave without Pay (LWOP) or leave state service? It depends. If you transfer from one state agency to another agency without a break in service, direct deposit may continue. If you go on leave without pay (LWOP), have a break in service when going to another agency, or leave state service entirely, direct deposit may discontinued. Please contact your Personnel Office to confirm your direct deposit status. Contact an Expert For State Direct Deposit Faculty, Staff, TA/GA, Hourly Non-Student and Student Assistant Payroll For last names A-CQ Karin Rafter State Payroll Services Phone: 645-4446 Email: karinraf@buffalo.edu For last names CR-HD Kathy Pohlman State Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-5202 Email: pohlman@buffalo.edu For last names HE-LT Roseann Brzozowiec State Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4449 Email: rbrzozow@buffalo.edu For last names LU-PQ Suzie Lesswing State Payroll Services Phone: 645-4425 Email: stfrank@buffalo.edu For last names PR-TG Erin Reese State Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4450 Email: erinrees@buffalo.edu For last names TH-Z Melissa Barone State Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4445 Email: mbarone@buffalo.edu State Appointment Processing Angela Kuc Director State Appointment Processing & Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4427 Email: akuc@buffalo.edu Lisa Battle State Appointment Processing Phone: 716-645-8156 Email: lpaschis@buffalo.edu Alexandra Brousse State Appointment Processing Phone: 716-645-4428 Email: asbrouss@buffalo.edu Katie Cartwright State Appointment Processing Phone: 645-5347 Email: kmangana@buffalo.edu For Research Foundation Direct Deposit Employment and Payroll — RF If Last Name Starts A - D Denise Katus RF Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4453 Email: katus@buffalo.edu If Last Name Starts G-K Joelle Tyler RF Payroll Phone: 716-645-4474 Email: jetyler@buffalo.edu If Last Name Starts E, F, L-M Sarah Lipczynski RF Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4355 Email: sds9@buffalo.edu If Last Name Starts N-S Sonia Cravatta RF Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4473 Email: cravatta@buffalo.edu If Last Name Starts T-Z Stephanie Gruarin RF Payroll Services Phone: 716-645-4479 Email: sgruarin@buffalo.edu For UB Foundation Direct Deposit UBF Payroll Administration Alissa Brayley Payroll Professional UB Foundation Phone: 716-645-8754 Email: alissabu@buffalo.edu Rakesh Shrestha Payroll Professional UB Foundation Phone: 716-645-8734 Email: rakeshsh@buffalo.edu Kate Fisher Payroll Manager UB Foundation Phone: 716-645-8735 Email: fisher36@buffalo.edu General Questions (Direct Deposit, Accufund Portal, Tax Withholding, Garnishments, etc.) Email UBF Payroll Submit a Timesheet or Questions About Timesheets Email UBF Timesheets ePTF Questions Payroll Manager Payroll Manager UB Foundation Email: ubf-payroll@buffalo.edu Site Index About the Division of Finance and Administration 1/21/25 Leadership and Organization 3/17/22 Staff Directory UB Directory Emergency 7/21/26 University Police 4/3/25 Emergency Management Policy, Compliance and Internal Controls 4/4/25 UB Policy Library 9/2/26 Internal Controls 4/3/25 Records Management 4/3/25 Freedom of Information Law (FOIL) Internal Audit EthicsPoint HR For Student Employees 5/20/26 College Work-Study 7/9/25 My Benefits 7/9/25 Taxes for International Students 7/9/25 Time Sheets Employment 9/8/26 Required Annual Trainings 9/21/15 Notice Of Non-Discrimination 3/5/26 Employment and Workplace Regulations and Policies Information for Suppliers Campus Mail 2/4/26 Campus Mail Services Request Resource Planning 10/1/24 Unit Business Officers (UBOs) and Resource Planners Parking and Transportation 8/24/26 Bus and Shuttle Schedules Print Services 3/24/26 Print Services Ordering System Instructions Traveling for Business 11/11/25 Before and During Your Trip UB Sustainability 7/20/26 Get Involved Related Websites 7/21/26 Emerging Leaders Program Office of the Provost Policies and Guidelines for Faculty and Staff Sponsored Projects Services SUNY SUNY RF University at Buffalo Foundation For Administrative Services Staff 2/20/26 VPFA Communicators Toolkit 6/19/26 Business Services Employee Engagement Hub Log In to Procurement Intranet Website Comments 9/30/24 Can't find something? Send us your feedback about the website. University at Buffalo . All rights reserved.  | Privacy | Accessibility Your Privacy is Important To Us. Buffalo.edu uses cookies to help build a better website experience for our visitors. Learn more in our Privacy Policy . Okay"
