    "https://www.buffalo.edu/administrative-services/training/career-coaching.html": {
      "title": "Seek Coaching for My Career",
      "description": "Seek Coaching for My Career at UB - Administrative Services Gateway - University at Buffalo Skip to Content (UB) Division of Finance and Administration University at Buffalo (UB) Division of Finance and Administration Administrative Services Gateway Building partnerships through collaboration. Toggle Navigation Menu 8/4/26 Human Resources 10/13/25 Managing Facilities 10/15/25 Managing Procurement 7/17/25 Managing Money 5/6/25 Travel & Expense 5/19/26 Human Resources 10/13/25 Managing Facilities 5/15/26 Managing Procurement 4/3/25 Managing Money 7/9/26 Traveling for Business Search Administrative Services > Organizational Development > Seek Coaching for My Career at UB Organizational Development Training Catalog UB EDGE Performance Online Program (POP) Discover Ways to Develop and Improve Myself Find Resources to Learn a Computing Skill Seek Coaching for My Career at UB Customize Training for My Team Develop Skills To Help Me Manage My Employees Evaluate My Department’s Training Needs Seek Advice on Planning a Team-Building Event Prepare Search Committees to Interview Candidates Change Management Related Links 7/6/22 About Organizational Development and Effectiveness 8/26/15 Faculty and Staff Training and Development Request Seek Coaching for My Career at UB On this page: Using a strengths-based coaching approach, our experts will help you explore your natural areas of strength and determine ways to leverage them to enhance or further your career. Career Coaching Can Help You Examine natural talents and use them to your advantage at work Develop plans to improve yourself Sharpen your skills Refine resumes and cover letters Consider ways to translate current skills into a different type of role Increase job satisfaction and engagement Address specific skill gaps and/or performance concerns Performance Support Coaching Looking for help with your job performance? We collaborate with you to strategize ways to enhance your abilities and overcome performance challenges. This includes leveraging your talents and interests. We explore your communication style and work environment to create attainable goals. In collaboration with our performance coach and your immediate supervisor, you will develop a personalized and actionable Individual Development Plan (IDP). Identify specific skill gaps or performance challenges Develop a working knowledge of the different DISC Communication styles Understand your communication strengths, challenges and development areas Sharpen your communication and interpersonal skills Develop realistic, actionable, SMART performance goals Increase job satisfaction and engagement Contact a Coach Kelli Hennessy Director Employee Engagement and Success Phone: 716-645-4437 Email: kmh35@buffalo.edu Kerry Gangi Program Coordinator and Communication Specialist Employee Engagement and Success Phone: 716-645-3568 Email: klynch4@buffalo.edu Michele Poitras Employee Engagement and Success Phone: 716-645-4457 Email: poitras@buffalo.edu Related Forms, Training and Resources Forms 8/26/15 Faculty and Staff Training and Development Request Training 9/18/25 Training Catalog Resources Develop a Plan for your Career at UB.pdf Individual Development Plan (IDP) Worksheet 5 Tips for Applying for a Job Within UB.pdf Webpage Feedback Didn't Find What You Were Looking For? Please leave blank What's missing or wrong? (Required) Your email address (We'd like to respond to you.) Security Check (Required) Upcoming Workshops Loading events… See All Upcoming Workshops > Site Index About the Division of Finance and Administration 1/21/25 Leadership and Organization 3/17/22 Staff Directory UB Directory Emergency 7/21/26 University Police 4/3/25 Emergency Management Policy, Compliance and Internal Controls 4/4/25 UB Policy Library 9/2/26 Internal Controls 4/3/25 Records Management 4/3/25 Freedom of Information Law (FOIL) Internal Audit EthicsPoint HR For Student Employees 5/20/26 College Work-Study 7/9/25 My Benefits 7/9/25 Taxes for International Students 7/9/25 Time Sheets Employment 9/8/26 Required Annual Trainings 9/21/15 Notice Of Non-Discrimination 3/5/26 Employment and Workplace Regulations and Policies Information for Suppliers Campus Mail 2/4/26 Campus Mail Services Request Resource Planning 10/1/24 Unit Business Officers (UBOs) and Resource Planners Parking and Transportation 8/24/26 Bus and Shuttle Schedules Print Services 3/24/26 Print Services Ordering System Instructions Traveling for Business 11/11/25 Before and During Your Trip UB Sustainability 7/20/26 Get Involved Related Websites 7/21/26 Emerging Leaders Program Office of the Provost Policies and Guidelines for Faculty and Staff Sponsored Projects Services SUNY SUNY RF University at Buffalo Foundation For Administrative Services Staff 2/20/26 VPFA Communicators Toolkit 6/19/26 Business Services Employee Engagement Hub Log In to Procurement Intranet Website Comments 9/30/24 Can't find something? Send us your feedback about the website. University at Buffalo . All rights reserved.  | Privacy | Accessibility Your Privacy is Important To Us. Buffalo.edu uses cookies to help build a better website experience for our visitors. Learn more in our Privacy Policy . Okay"
