ministration Operations Unit Advancement, Health Sciences Unit Animal Facilities Unit Artificial Intelligence Institute Unit Buffalo Institute for Genomics and Data Analyti... Business Services Unit Business and Entrepreneur Partnerships Unit CIO Administrative CIO Retired Entities Unit Center for Computational Research Unit Center for Ingestive Behavior Research Unit Central University Unit Clinical Research Office Unit Clinical and Research Institute on Addictions College of Arts and Sciences Unit Communities of Excellence Unit Community Health Equity Research Institute Division of Athletics Unit Educational Collaboration and Engagement Unit Emergency Planning Enrollment Management Unit Equity and Inclusion Unit Facilities Unit Faculty Affairs Unit Graduate Education Unit Graduate School of Education Unit Health Sciences Information Technology Unit Health Sciences Unit Human Resources Unit Inclusive Excellence Unit Independent Entities Unit Independent Entities Unit B Independent Entities Unit C Independent Entities Unit D Independent Entities Unit E Independent Entities Unit F Independent Entities Unit G Independent Entities Unit H Intercollegiate Athletics Unit Internal Audit Unit International Education Unit Jacobs School of Medicine and Biomedical Scienc... Law School Unit Men's Sports Unit Non-Operating Resources Unit Nys Center of Excellence In Bioinformatics and ... Office of Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Unit Office of General Counsel Office of Institutional Analysis Unit Office of Research Advancement & Strategic Init... Office of Research Compliance Unit Office of University Communications Unit Office of the President Unit Office of the Provost Unit Office of the VP for Finance & Administration Office of the VP for University Advancement Unit Office of the Vice President for Student Life Parking and Transportation Services Unit President Unit Provost Unit Provostal Institutes Unit Recreation Instruction Unit Recreation and Intramural Services Unit Renew Institute Unit Research and Economic Development Unit Resource Planning Unit School of Architecture and Planning Unit School of Dental Medicine Unit School of Engineering and Applied Sciences Unit School of Management Unit School of Nursing Unit School of Pharmacy and Pharmaceutical Sciences ... School of Public Health and Health Professions ... School of Social Work Unit Sponsored Projects Services Unit Sponsored Research Administration Student Entrepreneur Development Unit Student Life Unit Sustainability Unit Technology Transfer Unit The University at Buffalo Unit UADV - Campaigns Unit UADV Administration Unit UADV Advancement Unit UADV Alumni Engagement and Annual Giving Unit UB Biorepository Unit UB Genomics and Bioinformatics Core UC Retired Entities and Accounts Unit Undergraduate Education Univ Shared Governance: Faculty & Professional ... University Advancement Unit University Communications Unit University Libraries Unit University Police Unit VPRED Centers and Institutes Unit VPRED Operations Unit VPRED Retired Entities and Accounts Unit VPSL Administrative Operations Unit VPSL Campus Living Unit VPSL Dean of Students VPSL Health & Wellness Unit VPSL Housing Operations VPSL Marketing, Communications and Outreach Unit VPSL Retired Entities and Accounts VPSL Student Success and Engagement Women's Sports Unit Posting Category No Selection Faculty Staff Research Temporary View Results (1\n    ) Job Title Posting Number Department Position Type Deadline for Applications Plant Utilities Engineer 1, Chilled Water Plant C260016 Chilled Water Plant State Classified Open Until Filled As a Plant Utilities Engineer 1 at the University at Buffalo you will be responsible for:Operate steam and hot water boilers including lighting off, firing, cleaning and shutting down system. Operate central and auxiliary computers which monitor, test, control and operate boilers, auxiliary equipment and HVAC systems. Operate boiler, feed water, condensate and hot water supply and return system... View Details Bookmark Human Resources Townsend Hall 205 Hayes Rd Buffalo, NY 14214 716-645-7777 ub-hr@buffalo.edu UB is an AA/EOE and welcomes all to apply including veterans and individuals with disabilities. Arrangements will be made if an applicant has a disability in order to provide access to the application, interview and selection process upon request. Reasonable accommodation requests must be made in a timely manner by email at diversity@buffalo.edu or by phone 716-645-2266. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
